# Deliberately NOT denied: oeis.org. The OEIS entry for perfect powers does
# carry the answer in a comment, but denying the host would disable
# `oeis_lookup` entirely, and the sequence data itself is legitimate and useful
# here. The content screen is the right layer — the comment naming the result
# trips the [block] terms above, while the terms of the sequence come through.
